    {
        "text": "Course set. Drizzles observed. Wayside stations will allow passage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "Incoming telegram from Viscount Dawson. They would like to use this journey as an opportunity to meet with the Dublinn representative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio Broadcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "More nobles coming over to our side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you worry. The Leader won't deign to make them any statements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did they think a simple show of friendliness would earn them a guarantee of peace from Dublinn, a Taran population kept in check?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "I say at some point, they need to learn what constitutes true sincerity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Leader is still sending you to negotiate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps I <i>should</i> fritter away some more time, at least enough that people forget about me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Good to hear. You've made your share of errors by my standards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh... well, since you came back to report on your lonesome, I take it you haven't caught Loughshinny yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't ask rhetorical questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "text": "You hindered my ranks in their search, only to then leak her prior trail to my men. Not exactly a smart way to save someone, in your case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And how do you know it wasn't you I was saving?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, I don't recall The Leader ever saying anything about executing her. Do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Leader did allow her to roam free. The Leader also allowed me to deal with her at my own discretion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't blame me for being harsh on your friend, Harmonie. In these times, no one in their right mind would let a Draco act freely in Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, never you mind that. I don't think we were ever that close, anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you see, I'm about to pay a visit to that medical organization she was holing up in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm-hm-hmm! Maybe, just maybe, I'll be the first to get her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, a building in the way? Blast this low visibility! How was this not foreseen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who signed off on navigation plans? Which team was on survey yesterday?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late for the fleet to turn. Check for any presence of personnel in the building.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excellent... Brick and wooden construction, small enough not to pose a threat to the ship's treads. Continue on course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... would you look at that, another tiny mistake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There are always sacrifices to be made in war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I gather what you mean. But listen\u2014I have my own sense of 'discretion'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "text": "Loughshinny as a sacrifice? I say that might be too high a price to pay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_228_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The blood of the Draco still flows in her veins, you see. She remains ever so useful, even with Oripathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Harmonie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
