    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I did not bring her back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "text": "She has no resolve to fight, but is plenty capable of fleeing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Further to which... we pursued her tracks to where the old Taran palace stood. The fires within the ruins have gone out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Becoming Infected may have changed her Originium Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You seem to think it was Oripathy that made her stronger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh... of course not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's my sister. It would be disappointing if she couldn't even hold her own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me. Who's with her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_723_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A few vagrants. She calls herself the Leader before them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'The Brigadier'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_722_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then there's no need to follow her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since she has at last awakened, and become aware of her power as a Draco...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "text": "She will return to me soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eblana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
