    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure the long-haul trucks pass through here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aye, I hitched on one when I fled Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Bagpipe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember when I asked you... what the truth you wanted was, and what you wanted to do after learning it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you knew things would turn out this way. Most things that happen in Victoria end up as a power struggle like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, you could say... but it's never the same people involved, each time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "My feelings still haven't changed. I have to submit my report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I just wonder, you know... when will any part of Victoria truly accept it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "What can I even do, personally speakin', to speed up that process?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You still want to change Victoria, after all this? It amazes me how you're so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what? Stupid? Stubborn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So strong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, Chenchen, that's why we've always been friends, na? We fixate on a goal and don't change it easily. Not me, not you, not my leader!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha. Doesn't seem like a compliment when it's from you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I've been thinkin' these days, anyway... who's to say someone else's dream can't be achieved, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "(White noise)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still holding onto that thing Fionn gave you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aye. What's wrong with that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me do it... It's an old radio, and I don't want you to turn it into scrap metal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_devicebeep",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 0.4
