    {
        "text": "...the attention of all citizens. The conflict in Londinium between Victoria and Kazdel continues to escalate...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio"
    },
    {
        "text": "War has... *static*... broken out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Duke of Wellington... *static*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Radio"
    },
    {
        "text": "We ask you make war preparations...",
        "tag": "name",
