    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "34_g1_victoriavillage",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm driving back. I noted nothing unusual during my recon assignment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The office I used for my last identity? You needn't worry. I'll erase all trails as soon as I return.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I'll accept promotion from the Duke, if all goes according to plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't plan to hide it. I'll have abandoned my personal identity and face by that point. Whatever I say to you now under my current guise doesn't matter, does it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I'll get off and take a little walk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sir, would you like a wooden doll? I've brought some from a village on the other side of the river. The woman who makes them, excellent craft, bless her old heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright... excuse me, are you from around here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, just thought you looked familiar? Really, I'm sorry, I just settled down, I still don't know the people around here all too well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Fionn. Peddler of wares. Let me know if you want to buy or sell anything, and I'll sort it for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "I live right there, see? That house, just finished yesterday. It's a little far from the village, but I like it here right next to the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, er, there's your car, I see... Do I have the wrong person?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry for bothering you and all, I won't keep you any\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$smallearthquake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_autocannon",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "At a massive rumbling, they both turn around."
    },
    {
        "text": "A huge shadow looms on the horizon, the earth trembling beneath their feet."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-What's that sound?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Nonono, what's THAT?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "An army?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yesterday, 400km away, I signed off on a reconnaissance mission scouting this force.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All along, I've been of the belief that with his militant vice grip, the Iron Duke is our greatest enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "With his support, Dublinn will incite hatred amongst the population, dragging innocent people into riot and even outright war. We must find a way to check his power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hundreds, if not thousands of lives, hinge upon my every move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as for the moment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "He could not let out a sound if he tried."
    },
    {
        "text": "Rumble. Rumble."
    },
    {
        "text": "The battle fleet, led by a grand high-speed battleship, sails along its set course."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the territory of Duke Caster. She has silently assented to all this, assented to war passing through her roads and across Victoria."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Flee, Taran.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You built your house in the wrong place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This belt remains the territory of Duke Caster. The boundary is vague, and you have yet to cross it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Marquess of Trent did not switch over to the Duke of Wellington's side come the conclusion of negotiations. Moreover, pressure on the Tarans is set to increase once again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you'll sight those brutal patrol squads again in the next two days. Perhaps they haven't forgotten the appearance of your name in the case files.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did he mistake the Duke's intentions? Is he simply another pawn sacrificed in this war?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of us know the answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if we did, that lone hut would not be built in a wrong place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, what <i>are</i> you going on about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Wait, I remember now! You! You're the one who came after us back then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "W-What are you trying to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cardoorc",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$sportscarstart",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Fischer does not answer. He simply turns, gets back in the car, and starts the engine."
    },
    {
        "text": "Behind him, the sound of the tiny brick hut collapsing, and the plaintive cry of the villager, are drowned out in the deep cacophony of the battleship at the head."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
